    "name": "Dogwood",
    "steam_appid": 3682380,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.poster.avif?t=1749942097\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.webm?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.mp4?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOGWOOD</strong> is an action-adventure restaurant sim where you play as a gun-wielding pup by day and a chef by night. Explore lush biomes, fight (or tame!) plant creatures, challenge bosses, and cook for furry friends as you uncover a heartwarming tale, where hope is served one plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbMeet a host of colorful characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/439f7bb165df052417c3d9b20c5c2001.avif?t=1749942097\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world scarred by war and teetering on the brink of famine, an unlikely hero rises with a surprising gift. Step into the paws of Doug as he endeavors to save his town from disaster, where his culinary pursuits attract both friends and foes alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbBecome the top dog!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.poster.avif?t=1749942097\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.webm?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.mp4?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and tame plant creatures in top-down shooter combat with a twist! Master the art of color switching to survive the wilderness, all while collecting valuable ingredients for your restaurant.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbLet him cook.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.poster.avif?t=1749942097\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.webm?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/669b477efed4a30a7a3af14cf1f96858.mp4?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long day of foraging, cook up your spoils in the restaurant. Discover a variety of dishes, watch out for trends, and cater to your customers' unique taste preferences. If things get too hectic, then relax the music (and difficulty)!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.poster.avif?t=1749942097\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.webm?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/44a8a056f463470516f11a24b7f00f92.mp4?t=1749942097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOGWOOD</strong> is an action-adventure restaurant sim where you play as a gun-wielding pup by day and a chef by night. Explore lush biomes, fight (or tame!) plant creatures, challenge bosses, and cook for furry friends as you uncover a heartwarming tale, where hope is served one plate at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbMeet a host of colorful characters.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/439f7bb165df052417c3d9b20c5c2001.avif?t=1749942097\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world scarred by war and teetering on the brink of famine, an unlikely hero rises with a surprising gift. Step into the paws of Doug as he endeavors to save his town from disaster, where his culinary pursuits attract both friends and foes alike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u30fbBecome the top dog!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682380/extras/958e3fd0265d504fc7c454f68c256036.poster.avif?t=1749942097\" width=610 height=344 ><source s